/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (Anger tends to contract the muscles and increase the activation of the organism, someone may do hours of yoga, but if they do not recognize their anger, they will continue to have a contracted body and an organism that does not calm down.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (Sadness can weigh down the posture of the body, lower energy and slow movement, someone may attend all the motivational courses in the world and repeat mantras endlessly, but if they do not recognize their sadness, they will always fall into sluggishness.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (Anxiety is often accompanied by shallow breathing and constant tension, someone may practice and discipline themselves to act continuously, but if they do not recognize and accept that they are afraid of being afraid, things will never go the way they want.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
